WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.875
Six squares in a row do not fold. Move two and it works.

2
00:00:04.554 --> 00:00:07.904
Six squares in a row. Some land on the same face.

3
00:00:08.857 --> 00:00:11.007
Take the last two squares away.

4
00:00:14.426 --> 00:00:16.651
Add one above, and one below.
